از (انحشار البراز)","Faecal loading / impaction","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/gallstones.jpg","حصى المرارة","Gallstones (cholelithiasis)","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/ingested-foreign-body.jpg","جسم غريب مبلوع","Ingested foreign body","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/lbo-rp50391.jpg","انسداد الأمعاء الغليظة (القولون)","Large bowel obstruction (LBO)","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/pancreatic-calcification.jpg","تكلّسات البنكرياس (التهاب البنكرياس المزمن)","Pancreatic calcification (chronic pancreatitis)","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/pneumoperitoneum-decubitus.jpg","استرواح الصفاق بوضعية الاستلقاء على الجنب الأيسر","Pneumoperitoneum on left lateral decubitus","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/porcelain-gallbladder.jpg","المرارة الخزفية","Porcelain gallbladder","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/renal-calculi.jpg","حصى الكلى والحالب (الحصاة القرنية)","Renal / ureteric calculi (staghorn)","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/rigler-sign.jpg","استرواح الصفاق على صورة البطن (علامة ريغلر)","Pneumoperitoneum on supine film (Rigler sign)","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/sbo.jpg","انسداد الأمعاء الدقيقة","Small bowel obstruction (SBO)","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/sigmoid-volvulus.jpg","التواء القولون السيني","Sigmoid volvulus","xray"],["atlas/xray/abdomen/img/toxic-megacolon.jpg","تضخّم القولون السمّي","Toxic megacolon","xray"],["atlas/xray/ankle-foot/img/ankle-maisonneuve-fracture.jpg","كسر ميزونوف","Maisonneuve fracture","xray"],["atlas/xray/ankle-foot/img/bimalleolar-fracture.jpg","كسر الكعبين","Bimalleolar fracture","xray"],["atlas/xray/ankle-foot/img/calcaneal-fracture.jpg","كسر عظم العقب","Calcaneal fracture","xray"],["atlas/xray/ankle-foot/img/calcaneal-spur.jpg","شوكة العقب","Plantar calcaneal spur","xray"],["atlas/xray/ankle-foot/img/foot-gout.jpg","النقرس في المفصل المشطي السلامي الأول","Gout (1st MTP joint)","xray"],["atlas/xray/ankle-foot/img/hallux-valgus.jpg","إبهام القدم الأروح","Hallux valgus","xray"],["atlas/xray/ankle-foot/img/jones-fracture.jpg